You can now use a SQL parameter or SQLScript variable as an array index. For example:CREATE TABLE T1(ARR INT ARRAY);
INSERT INTO T1 VALUES (ARRAY(1,2,3,4));
SELECT ARR[?] FROM T1;See [Multi-valued Data Types](https://help.sap.com/docs/HANA_CLOUD_DATABASE/c1d3f60099654ecfb3fe36ac93c121bb/cae8b00a6a964cb8a06d2c00dac4ad05.html)
